        "title": "Ntau kathan njianmei pu",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ntau kathan njianmei pu dang khou,",
            "Poubaumei ram tik dai;",
            "Neilamei munrim gaimei puang the,",
            "Puang tuai dat pulak khe.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Neila pui kai khou kariu puni,",
            "Tingkau rimei le bangmei guai le;",
            "Rianra pui ram khou kalang bammei,",
            "Pou hukhou neila pui lu suanni.",
            "",
            "2. Ai ringpui tingmik hei nai bam san khou,",
            "Akhang muang kumma jing;",
            "Aniu rui miram tang pui kan kgou rui,",
            "Kandih hei ning lakkhe.",
            "",
            "3. Hei kumpui namdai 6$% tangppui kan khou,",
            "Kandih hei ning lakkhe;",
            "Ntau karim nam gaimei 6$% nam the,",
            "He adi gaini cho ?",
            "",
            "4. Ata kanloumei kaipou hukhou,",
            "Kaguang hukhou bam me;",
            "Latjan suni kanloumei neila khang,",
            "Hallelujah Amen."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
